5e-iKE5TQ","date":"2015-01-09T18:15:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9002091884613037,"text_excerpt":"Let me first start by saying the workers are simply amazing. Very personable and always in good spirits. Quick service also. I've been at least 5 times but am always in the mood for the same 2 things. I'm a fan of the hot sausage on bun with cheese dressed with fries and tuna salad on toast. Once the cutting of the toast wasn't exact so the sandwich fell apart and I had more of a tuna salad (just broke up the bread and put it on a plate lol). It still was good though. I tried the bisque before and wasn't a huge fan of it. It was okay and I ate it but I wouldn't get it again. I'll be back."},{"business_id":"7eguS2DuAG-4B9EAHAP5Dw","review_id":"gWC8Gyye2CqgiNqt9Bqmpg","date":"2011-02-14T23:14:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8938740491867065,"text_excerpt":"I am giving this place a coveted five stars! The food is great for a deli, I especially always like the soup. The portions are huge, I always get lunch and a good afternoon snack or dinner from my visits. Great place to eat at or get carry out and prices are reasonable. If you work in the CBD or are just staying in a nearby hotel put FredRicks on the list. This is also a great breakfast spot."},{"business_id":"7eguS2DuAG-4B9EAHAP5Dw","review_id":"jfNGkszI83cnXWNAMhiuAg","date":"2013-12-06T21:42:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8857064247131348,"text_excerpt":"Not bad. Just a blue collar kind of sandwich shop. Lots of choices on the menu. The muffuletta was decent. Not the greatest but good. The drinks are bottled and in a glass cooler. Basically you help yourself to the drink you want. Place is easy on the wallet and much better than the higher cost joints in the tourist areas."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
